	BlindTusker: {
		DisplayName: Blind Tusker
		Bestiary: Its eyes are white all through. It hears you through the sand, and it does not stop for anything it cannot climb. Men went after it with curved swords. Some of the swords came back.
	}

	CreviceEelHead: {
		DisplayName: Crevice Eel
		Bestiary: It waits in a crack in the rock with only its head out, its mouth opening and shutting as if it were counting. Bleed anywhere in the caves and it comes the whole way, every turn of them, and never once looks lost.
	}

	CreviceEelBody.DisplayName: Crevice Eel

	GildedKnight: {
		DisplayName: Gilded Knight of Grace
		Bestiary: Plate gilded over, two swords as tall as he is, and a road before a wall that was never breached. He has been put down on that road more times than anyone has counted. He gets up.
	}
}

